<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_d40f29d0-bfe6-4a2b-b498-226880b4506e"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8a09c5ef-fc66-43db-8dec-78bb5c42d27e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_6e18bed1-c887-47a6-b642-2bc099aa3356"
id="sec.3-def.MartinPlaceReserve"><b><i>Martin Place
Reserve</i></b></defterm> means the public reserve in Martin Place, Sydney,
between Macquarie Street and George Street.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_21e42415-27b1-428f-b880-5d0bd7f5ac70"
id="sec.3-def.occupation"><b><i>occupation</i></b></defterm> of a public
reserve, includes the use of the reserve or the presence of a person in the
reserve.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_98c30fdd-4549-407b-8132-4a6d53f33e75"
id="sec.3-def.publicreserve"><b><i>public reserve</i></b></defterm>
means&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_79d33442-48cc-4cf5-a958-01a80d95b026" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">land dedicated or reserved for a public purpose
under the <legref refid="act-1989-006" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Lands Act
1989</i></name></legref> or the <legref refid="act-2016-058" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown Land Management Act
2016</i></name></legref>, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c729b241-f195-43d8-92e4-ee6a0b79f1f4" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a public reserve within the meaning of the
<legref refid="act-1993-030" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Local Government Act
1993</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_795864fa-83f5-4039-baf9-15e88dcd960a"
id="sec.3-def.publicreservetowhichthisActapplies"><b><i>public reserve to
which this Act applies</i></b></defterm> means&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fbeec37d-3e51-482b-84d3-153ef92e9cfe" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a-oc.2">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Martin Place Reserve, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b0a2619f-0780-4c6a-ad70-cd9a67facccc" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b-oc.2">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any other public reserve in the City of Sydney to
which this Act is applied by a proclamation under Part
2.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_27c6c25f-5361-4e18-bb46-4f4edd845ce4"
id="sec.3-def.thepublic"><b><i>the public</i></b></defterm> includes any
section of the public.</txt></block></deflist>
</block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_d51b8fd6-8dc9-4f3a-8abb-738366b29c91"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note"><heading guid="_51ea7192-14e8-49ec-8cf0-efbe9f37a4d0"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref refid="act-1987-015" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation Act
1987</i></name></legref> contains definitions and other provisions that affect
the interpretation and application of this Act.</txt></block></note>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_69630e07-8b37-4353-9b08-c438e39d957d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notes included in this Act do not form part of
this Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


